{title: _Test Song Files Blessed Assurance}
{meta: author Fanny Crosby}
{composer: Phoebe Palmer Knapp}
{copyright: Public Domain}
{key: D}
{tempo: 100}
{time: 9/8}
{tag: Assurance}
{tag: Praise}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Blessed as[G]surance, [D]Jesus is mine!
O what a fore[A]taste of glory di[D]vine!
Heir of sal[G]vation, [D]purchase of God,
Born of His [A]Spirit, washed [A7]in His [D]blood.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[D]This is my [G]story, [D]this is my song,
Praising my [A]Savior all the day [D]long;
This is my [G]story, [D]this is my song,
Praising my [A]Savior all [A7]the day [D]long.
{end_of_chorus}
